          ],
          "content": "**Nature’s wonders:** You might have You might have seen some insects emitting light inseen some insects emitting light in a garden or a field in late evenings.a garden or a field in late evenings. These insects are called fireflies, andThese insects are called fireflies, and their light is produced by a chemicaltheir light is produced by a chemical change. This type of light productionchange. This type of light production (without heat) in living organisms is(without heat) in living organisms is called bioluminescence."
